-- test: ADR 0067 amendment (2026-10-06), G15_tapp_into_public_field_c: a T value decided by comparing T values goes where a value of T is expected (a lambda, a higher-order function, a function result, an `edit` binding or a field of the body), which edition 0.2 rejects in the generic body; the control, sound, is rejected there, an accepted cost, since accepting it soundly would need re-checking lambdas (spec/07 §7 rule 8, #92)
-- spec: spec/07 §7
-- expect: error U4001 at src/g15_tapp_into_public_field_c.una:9:67
module g15_tapp_into_public_field_c

kind Rec
  n: Int

apply[T](a: T, b: T, p: T, q: T, k: fn(T) -> Int) -> Rec = Rec(n: k(if a == b then p else q))

pub leak(s: Int) -> Int = apply([s], b: [0], p: [], q: [1, 2], k: fn(xs) -> xs.len).n
